commit b8489b20a36a3f026beaebbf6fe6da1d8da7e88a
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 01:35:33 2026 +0000

    Add a tasks board for the committee
    
    The task sheet export (incoming/tasks.csv) becomes boards/tasks, as the
    12 Nov minutes asked: grouped by person so each member can find what's
    theirs (Ines, Hal), unowned tasks first because "nobody's on it" was the
    recurring failure (water meter, shed gutter), overdue/this-week marked,
    done tasks folded away (Tomas), polytunnel rota on top (Dot, 29 Oct).
    
    kit/board.py gains opt-in board.json keys for this (section without a
    date, date columns, done_label, rota). The events board uses none of
    them; rebuilt for its last build date it is byte-identical. Status and
    names match ignoring case, since the export has "Done" and "priya".
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

